  "title": "Qt: Enable Edit Name Resolution for EXPORTED_PDU",
  "description": "In an exported pdu frame there may be tags with IP addresses, these are put in the source and destination columns.\nBut it is not possible to do manual IP address resolution as the GUI is checking if there is an IP layer in the\nprotocol hierarchy, which there isn't. So extend the check to check if an IP address is set in pinfo net_src or net_dst\nin the case we have an exported PDU.",
